OL,3,GNEWSABidston Windmill added to at-risk
OL,4,Aheritage list
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Wirral landmark has been placed on
OL,7,Fthe list of heritage sites at risk.
OL,9,FThe Grade II listed Bidston Windmill is
OL,10,Fsaid to require urgent repairs.
OL,12,FBeing inckuded in Historic England's
OL,13,Fheritage at-risk register means the
OL,14,F18th century structure will be eligible
OL,15,Ffor more funding.
OL,17,FWirral Council said it is committed to
OL,18,Frestoring the "important part of the
OL,19,Fborough's heritage and a valued
OL,20,Flandmark".
